{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09199","headline":"荅贡士黎逢 · 韦应物","name":"荅贡士黎逢","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"茂等方上达，诸生安可希。\n栖神澹物表，涣汗布令词。\n如彼崑山玉，本自有光辉。\n鄙人徒区区，称叹亦何爲。\n弥月旷不接，公门但驱驰。\n兰章忽有赠，持用慰所思。\n不见心尚密，况当相见时。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09199.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09199","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}